<view class="page {{theme}}"><view class="title">阅读与服务设置</view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">外观</text></view><view class="segmented"><button class="{{selectedTheme === 'system' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="system" bindtap="onTheme">跟随系统</button><button class="{{selectedTheme === 'light' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="light" bindtap="onTheme">浅色</button><button class="{{selectedTheme === 'dark' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="dark" bindtap="onTheme">深色</button></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">释义字号</text></view><view class="segmented"><button class="{{fontSize === 14 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-size="14" bindtap="onSize">小</button><button class="{{fontSize === 16 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-size="16" bindtap="onSize">标准</button><button class="{{fontSize === 18 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-size="18" bindtap="onSize">大</button></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">发音与朗读</text></view>
<view class="card voice-settings">
 <text class="setting-label">词条与词卡音源</text>
 <view class="segmented"><button class="{{voiceMode === 'auto' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="auto" bindtap="onVoiceMode">原版优先</button><button class="{{voiceMode === 'tts' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="tts" bindtap="onVoiceMode">系统合成</button><button class="{{voiceMode === 'original' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="original" bindtap="onVoiceMode">仅原版</button></view>
 <view class="small muted voice-note">仅原版在缺少对应录音时停止发音；原版优先可使用系统合成。</view>
 <text class="setting-label">默认英文口音</text>
 <view class="segmented"><button class="{{voiceVariant === 'UK' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-variant="UK" bindtap="onVoiceVariant">英式</button><button class="{{voiceVariant === 'US' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-variant="US" bindtap="onVoiceVariant">美式</button></view>
 <view class="voice-catalog-head"><text class="setting-label">已安装合成音色</text><button class="text-button" disabled="{{voiceLoading}}" bindtap="onLoadVoices">{{voiceLoading ? '读取中…' : '读取音色'}}</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{voiceCatalogStatus}}" class="small muted voice-note">{{voiceCatalogStatus}}</view>
 <text class="small muted">当前英文口音的音色</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{voiceOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{voiceIndex}}" disabled="{{voiceLoading}}" data-kind="en" bindchange="onInstalledVoice"><view class="voice-picker"><text>{{voiceOptions[voiceIndex].label}}</text><text>›</text></view></picker>
 <text class="small muted">中文合成音色</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{zhVoiceOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{zhVoiceIndex}}" disabled="{{voiceLoading}}" data-kind="zh" bindchange="onInstalledVoice"><view class="voice-picker"><text>{{zhVoiceOptions[zhVoiceIndex].label}}</text><text>›</text></view></picker>
 <text class="setting-label">合成朗读语速</text>
 <view class="segmented"><button class="{{ttsRate === -2 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-rate="-2" bindtap="onTtsRate">慢速</button><button class="{{ttsRate === 0 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-rate="0" bindtap="onTtsRate">标准</button><button class="{{ttsRate === 2 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-rate="2" bindtap="onTtsRate">快速</button></view>
 <view class="small muted voice-note">原版录音保持原速。已有播放断点使用保存的音源与口音，新播放任务使用这里的默认值。</view>
 <button class="voice-preview" bindtap="onPreview">{{previewing ? '停止试听' : '试听合成音色'}}</button>
 <view wx:if="{{voicePreviewStatus}}" class="small muted voice-preview-status">{{voicePreviewStatus}}</view>
</view>
<view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">离线词库</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onDictionaries">管理牛津词库</button></view><view class="small muted">已导入牛津包后，查词、音标、双语例句和中文反查可完全离线使用。内置另有 {{offlineCount}} 个开源或原创示例。</view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">配套服务</text><switch color="{{accent}}" checked="{{online}}" bindchange="onOnline"/></view><view class="small muted">朗读、识图、语音转写及尚未配置的 AI 服务使用以下地址。用户笔记和复习进度不会自动上传。</view><input class="field address" value="{{apiBase}}" placeholder="http://本机或局域网地址:18748" bindinput="onAddress"/><button class="primary" loading="{{checking}}" disabled="{{checking}}" bindtap="onConnect">保存并检查连接</button><view wx:if="{{statusText}}" class="info">{{statusText}}</view><view wx:if="{{serviceRows.length}}" class="card service-list"><view wx:for="{{serviceRows}}" wx:key="name" class="service-row"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="small {{item.available ? 'available' : 'muted'}}">{{item.available ? '可用' : '待配置'}}</text></view><view class="small muted">{{item.detail}}</view></view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">本地数据</text></view><view class="card about"><button class="text-button" bindtap="onBackup">完整学习备份与恢复</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="onClearCache">仅清理查词缓存</button><view>账号、支付、广告和推送维持移除。只有主动拍照、录音、选择或分享文件时，才使用相应微信能力。</view><view>牛津内容不在公开仓库中分发。原版录音与插图需另行导入对应 MDD 文件，普通朗读使用服务端实际安装的音色。</view><view>本机数据可能因清理微信数据、删除小程序或存储故障而丢失，请主动导出学习备份。</view></view></view>
